(text "BATMAN / SUPPLY3" (at 15 16 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left)) (uuid b8ecb323-0201-51bb-9f9b-38726e4a6135))
(text "PCB C: DISTRIBUTION ONLY, no regulator. J23 receives 3V3/GND/SENS_PWR from ESP PCB A.\nJ24 supplies PCB B sensors: GND/3V3_SENS. J30 is a spare 3V3/GND output.\nQ3 switches sensor supply only. Do NOT connect another regulator to this 3V3 rail." (at 15 23 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left)) (uuid 09ae5ac5-b42a-5c19-9789-7aa3faa6afd8))
